  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tanzania seed platform prolongation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prolongation of Tanzania Horticulture and Potato seed Platform for another two years.In recent years, the horticulture industry in Tanzania has gained popularity attracting a large number of investments, development partners, projects and recognition from the Government based on its potential to improve livelihoods, significant contribution to the country&apos;s economy, create employment opportunities and improve food security.Despite the recognition, the stakeholders in the horticulture industry in Tanzania are not well coordinated and most of the organizations implementing horticulture projects and activities are working in silos leading to duplication of efforts, waste of resources and time that could have been better utilized in other areas. Besides that, there are also many bottlenecks that blocks the development of the seed sector. To contribute to a solution to those problems a Tanzania Horticulture and Potato Seed Platform (THPSP) consisting out of a consortium of prominent horticulture actors in Tanzania will be set-up during this project. Within this platform different actors will join forces to address prevailing issues hindering the growth and sustainability of the horticulture industry through collaborative approach focusing on increasing access to quality horticulture seed and seed potatoes multiplication for sustainable farming in Tanzania.</narrative>
  </description>
